> </div> </div> </div>What kind of martial arts, and what's the martial artists' background?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12952-accelerator","name":"Accelerator","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3232"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-10-19T13:52:42-07:00","id":1419083,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Prince of the Night</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1336895-homebrew-charms-spells-evocation-gallery?p=1419076#post1419076\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"> Ideas on evocations for a Suit of Silken armor worn by a martial artist?</div> </div> </div> </div>I spent last month developing the Evocations for a suit of Silken Armor made for emulating the themes of the raiton. Its initial Evocation emulates the Raiton as a flyer, mimicking the Essence glider from the Ex3 Core; following that, it explores via Evocations the Raiton as scavenger, Raiton as cunning, and Raiton as eerie psychopomp. <br /> <br /> Further Evocations took those themes deeper, culminating ultimately in helping spirits resolve their unfinished business, recovering stolen memories, and stealing Essence from the night itself.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>He/him","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/177-thecountalucard","name":"TheCountAlucard","avatar":"https://forum.theo