","id":1420226,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Prince of the Night</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1336895-homebrew-charms-spells-evocation-gallery?p=1420188#post1420188\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Oh think a lightning bow or implosion bow have room for more evocations?</div> </div> </div> </div>Not a default one, no, but if you give this one a name, demonstrate that it's different somehow; perhaps a little something extra went into the making of it, or it experienced some sort of legendary conditions that awakened its inner spirit as it forged a bond with its wielder, et cetera., then yeah, go wild.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>He/him","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/177-thecountalucard","name":"TheCountAlucard","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar177_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10857"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-10-26T05:46:46-07:00","id":1420245,"title":"","content":"Technically nothing says that there <i>is</i> such thing as a \u201cdefault\u201d lightning ballista or implosion bow, so as weapons the assumption that each one is named and unique should apply.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/13313-sith_happens","name":"Sith_Happens","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core